---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="AI Adventure">
 <main class="page">
  <header class="page-header">
    <p class="eyebrow">Open adventures for AI</p>

    <h1>AI Adventure</h1>

    <p class="introduction">
      AI Adventure is an open format for interactive adventures powered by modern AI.
    </p>
  </header>

  <p>
    Choose an adventure, generate a launch prompt, and let your favourite AI
    become the storyteller.
  </p>

  <p>
    <a class="button" href="/adventures/">
      Browse Adventures
    </a>
  </p>

  <hr />

  <section>
    <h2>What is the AI Adventure Format?</h2>

    <p>
      AI Adventure uses an open, human-readable format that describes worlds
      rather than scripts, allowing every playthrough to be unique while staying
      true to the author's vision.
    </p>

    <p>
      <a href="/documentation/">Learn more about the format →</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</main>
</Layout>